### =============================================================================
### Antigravity Node.js - Localhost Command Center (Port 4000)
### =============================================================================
### Click "Send Request" above any block to execute immediately in VS Code.
### =============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

### 1. Health Check & Cluster Ping Latency
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Dynamic MongoDB URI Lookup from mongo_creds.creds (Zero Hardcoded IPs)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/uri/prod_jobiak_ai

### 3. Dynamic MongoDB URI Lookup for generateXml_prod
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/uri/generateXml_prod

### 4. List Configured Multi-Tenant Clients
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clients

### =============================================================================
### DEDICATED PARTNER ENGINES (COMPLETELY SEPARATED)
### =============================================================================

### 5. Daily Stats Engine (Reads daily_stats.input -> daily_stats.output)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dailystats

### 6. WhatJobs URL-Matching & Revenue Sync
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/whatjobs

### 7. JobGet Publisher CPA & CPC Sync
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobget

### 8. Banana Aggregator Syndication Snapshot
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/banana

### =============================================================================
### OPERATIONAL PIPELINES
### =============================================================================

### 9. Monthly Google Views Report for Google Sheets (Tarun)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/views?lead=tarun

### 10. Proxy Sliding-Window Updates
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/updates

### 11. Zero-Click Expiry Audit
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/expires

### 12. Feed Reconciliation (Staging vs Production)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/feed

### 13. Pre-Posting Ingestion Collision Gate (HCSG)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/collision
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client": "HCSG",
  "limit": 1000
}

### 14. Description HTML Cleaner (Strips Timestamps, Stray Dots, Apply Leaks)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/clean
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Dietary Aide",
  "description": "Posted Wednesday, August 26, 2026, 4:00 AM <p><strong>.</strong></p><p>Great job opportunity. Visit yescommunities.com/careers directly for confirmed position openings.</p>8401 E Saddlebrook Dr, Charleston SC"
}
